   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## H3 Image: realism text to image (v2.0)\n1. **Prompt**: keep the first sentence and the last one. Describe the picture in between: who or what, the action and expression, clothing, place and light.\n2. Pick the aspect ratio and megapixels (16–64 MP practical; 96 MP verified clean ceiling), then **Run** (Ctrl+Enter).\n\n**Why it looks real:** **H3 Realism Empty Picture** puts a black 512 px picture's vision tokens in front of the prompt on the first two steps (Kijai's trick, ported from KJNodes). With any picture in its conditioning, H3 renders in its clean reference mode instead of its crusty text-only mode, keeping crisp pores and individual hairs. **H3 Realism KSampler** runs `spectral + texture 8` (8 calls) for the sharpest T2I skin and hair, or switch `mode` to `spectral 6` for 6-call speed.\n\n**Seed:** on the sampler; each queue takes a new one. To refine a good result, drag it back into ComfyUI (it carries its workflow and seed), set the seed to fixed and change only the prompt.\n\n**Time:** about 25–35 s per 16 MP image on an RTX PRO 6000 (96 GB), once the models are loaded."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## H3 Image: realism text to image (v2.0)\n1. **Prompt**: keep the first sentence and the last one. Describe the picture in between: who or what, the action and expression, clothing, place and light.\n2. Pick the aspect ratio and megapixels (16–64 MP practical; 96 MP verified clean ceiling), then **Run** (Ctrl+Enter).\n\n**Why it looks real:** **H3 Realism Empty Picture** puts a black 512 px picture's vision tokens in front of the prompt on the first two steps (Kijai's trick, ported from KJNodes). With any picture in its conditioning, H3 renders in its clean reference mode instead of its crusty text-only mode, keeping crisp pores and individual hairs. **H3 Realism KSampler** runs `spectral + texture 8` (8 calls) for the sharpest T2I skin and hair, or switch `mode` to `spectral 6` for 6-call speed.\n\n**Seed:** on the sampler; each queue takes a new one. To refine a good result, drag it back into ComfyUI (it carries its workflow and seed), set the seed to fixed and change only the prompt.\n\n**Time:** about 25–35 s per 16 MP image on an RTX PRO 6000 (96 GB), once the models are loaded."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
  {
   "id": 62,
