   "flags": {},
   "order": 7,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Tips**\n- Leave the H3 Realism Empty Picture node in: it keeps the result clean. Without it, skin comes out crusty.\n- Candid moments read as real: an action, an unguarded expression, one personal detail.\n- Render a few seeds and pick. Hands, held objects and text can come out doubled or ghosted; that comes from the model's layout, and stock KSampler draws the same.\n- New text in the shot (a sign, a label): write it in quotes and change `Sharp skin detail, no text, no watermark.` to `Every letter of that text is spelled exactly as written and sharply readable. Sharp skin detail, no other text, no watermark.` Keep it short.\n- For a product or a place, `Sharp detail` fits better than `Sharp skin detail`. Patterned bowls and plates tend to grow made-up characters; ask for a plain one.\n- Above 16 MP: raise `megapixels` directly on the **H3 Realism Resolution Selector** (16–64 MP practical, 96 MP verified clean ceiling from Lab 1).\n- The LoRA loader (top right) is off; turn it on for a character LoRA. In our edit tests a character LoRA made skin smoother, so keep it at 0.5 or lower."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "**Tips**\n- Leave the H3 Realism Empty Picture node in: it keeps the result clean. Without it, skin comes out crusty.\n- Candid moments read as real: an action, an unguarded expression, one personal detail.\n- Render a few seeds and pick. Hands, held objects and text can come out doubled or ghosted; that comes from the model's layout, and stock KSampler draws the same.\n- New text in the shot (a sign, a label): write it in quotes and change `Sharp skin detail, no text, no watermark.` to `Every letter of that text is spelled exactly as written and sharply readable. Sharp skin detail, no other text, no watermark.` Keep it short.\n- For a product or a place, `Sharp detail` fits better than `Sharp skin detail`. Patterned bowls and plates tend to grow made-up characters; ask for a plain one.\n- Above 16 MP: raise `megapixels` directly on the **H3 Realism Resolution Selector** (16–64 MP practical, 96 MP verified clean ceiling from Lab 1).\n- The LoRA loader (top right) is off; turn it on for a character LoRA. In our edit tests a character LoRA made skin smoother, so keep it at 0.5 or lower."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
