   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "**comfyui-h3-sampler v2.0** (github.com/igorls/comfyui-h3-sampler): **H3 Realism KSampler** combines Euler layout steps with 2D FFT frequency-split re-noising and exponential Heun texture (`spectral + texture 8` default here; `spectral 6` for faster 6-call renders). **H3 Realism Empty Picture** keeps H3 in its clean reference mode (advanced `end = 0.25` for cleanest skin/landscapes, or `0.10` for step-0-only slightly crisper hair). **H3 Realism Resolution Selector** goes up to 96 MP+ directly on the canvas. Without the pack, use the RES4LYF version of this workflow."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "**comfyui-h3-sampler v2.0** (github.com/igorls/comfyui-h3-sampler): **H3 Realism KSampler** combines Euler layout steps with 2D FFT frequency-split re-noising and exponential Heun texture (`spectral + texture 8` default here; `spectral 6` for faster 6-call renders). **H3 Realism Empty Picture** keeps H3 in its clean reference mode (advanced `end = 0.25` for cleanest skin/landscapes, or `0.10` for step-0-only slightly crisper hair). **H3 Realism Resolution Selector** goes up to 96 MP+ directly on the canvas. Without the pack, use the RES4LYF version of this workflow."
   },
